You are helping a researcher who is building a systematic review of a broad construct. The ranking of the search results by similarity to the review's anchor texts pulled up a cluster of records that contains none of the review's benchmark papers. Your task is to decide whether this cluster is an **adjacent literature**: a neighbouring body of work that shares vocabulary with the target studies but does not answer the research question, and if so, to name it so the review can tell it apart from includes.

